{"server":"cn","storyId":"story_irene_set_1_story_1","groupId":"story_irene_set_1","stageId":null,"title":"灯火微明","storyCode":null,"avgTag":"幕间","sourcePath":"vendor/ArknightsGamedata/cn/gamedata/story/obt/memory/story_irene_1_1.txt","sourceHash":"f70c9dcdf4737cbe61ceee7daeed0e29bfed0ac463736735ae3d65617e8e7c1a","bodyAvailable":true,"blocks":[{"type":"background","backgroundId":"27_g26_dusk_wild"},{"type":"narration","text":"苍天，强风，原野，墓碑。\n这里是所有大审判官的坟场。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"审判官艾丽妮","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"narration","text":"艾丽妮还记得，第一次被老师带到这片墓园时的景象。\n她没敢告诉老师的是，当时的她心中被热切的使命感填满，牺牲对她来说是一种赞美。\n她因而觉得这片墓园被笼罩了一股神圣的美丽。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"27_g26_dusk_wild"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"审判官艾丽妮","speakerId":"avg_4009_irene_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（好美。）"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"大审判官达里奥","speakerId":"avg_npc_183","isRemote":false,"text":"艾丽妮。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"审判官艾丽妮","speakerId":"avg_4009_irene_1","isRemote":false,"text":"啊，我、我在，老师！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"大审判官达里奥","speakerId":"avg_npc_183","isRemote":false,"text":"既然你还是决定成为我的副手，那么，从今天起，我不仅是你的老师，更是你的长官。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"审判官艾丽妮","speakerId":"avg_4009_irene_1","isRemote":false,"text":"是，长官！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"大审判官达里奥","speakerId":"avg_npc_183","isRemote":false,"text":"这里，是我的导师在我成为审判官时，带我来的地方。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"大审判官达里奥","speakerId":"avg_npc_183","isRemote":false,"text":"这里的坟墓中大部分都是衣冠冢，毕竟，没有多少审判官在死后能够被找到完整的尸体。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"大审判官达里奥","speakerId":"avg_npc_183","isRemote":false,"text":"而相比肉体，提灯与武器更能代表一名审判官存在过的痕迹。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"大审判官达里奥","speakerId":"avg_npc_183","isRemote":false,"text":"因此，每一个牺牲在战斗中的审判官，他们的提灯和武器都会摆放在他们的坟前，以此作为纪念。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"大审判官达里奥","speakerId":"avg_npc_183","isRemote":false,"text":"而这里的九座墓碑，是九位圣徒的墓碑。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"审判官艾丽妮","speakerId":"avg_4009_irene_1","isRemote":false,"text":"九座......可是，您的老师，卡门阁下还健在吧？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"大审判官达里奥","speakerId":"avg_npc_183","isRemote":false,"text":"另外八位圣徒在漫长的旅程中一一陨落，而卡门阁下也早已指定这里作为他长眠的居所。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"审判官艾丽妮","speakerId":"avg_4009_irene_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"审判官艾丽妮","speakerId":"avg_4009_irene_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（如果我在捍卫伊比利亚的过程中牺牲，也能被葬在这里，该有多好。）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"大审判官达里奥","speakerId":"avg_npc_183","isRemote":false,"text":"艾丽妮。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"审判官艾丽妮","speakerId":"avg_4009_irene_1","isRemote":false,"text":"是！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"大审判官达里奥","speakerId":"avg_npc_183","isRemote":false,"text":"将来有一天，你也会抱着我的提灯与武器来到这里，将它们放在我的坟前。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"审判官艾丽妮","speakerId":"avg_4009_irene_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"大审判官达里奥","speakerId":"avg_npc_183","isRemote":false,"text":"到了那一刻，比起悲伤，我希望你已经明白了你战斗的意义。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"大审判官达里奥","speakerId":"avg_npc_183","isRemote":false,"text":"因为到了那时，将没有人可以再教导你。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"大审判官达里奥","speakerId":"avg_npc_183","isRemote":false,"text":"而在那之前，我会将我知道的一切都传授给你。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"艾丽妮记得自己的回答是一句响亮的“是！”\n但当时的她尚不明白老师那些话的重量，也不明白生命的重量。\n直到在斯图提斐拉号上经历了那一切，直到她如今抱着老师的提灯与武器，要将这些放在老师的坟前。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"审判官艾丽妮","speakerId":"avg_4009_irene_1","isRemote":false,"text":"这里的墓碑，又多了一些。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"艾丽妮走到一块墓碑前。\n“大审判官达里奥，沉眠于此。”\n一块木牌，一列简单的句子，没有任何额外的装饰，这就是一个大审判官的坟墓。\n她轻轻地将老师的提灯与武器放在墓前，生怕惊扰到老师的灵魂，然后，缓缓坐下。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"审判官艾丽妮","speakerId":"avg_4009_irene_1","isRemote":false,"text":"老师，这是您的提灯与武器。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"审判官艾丽妮","speakerId":"avg_4009_irene_1","isRemote":false,"text":"按照您的要求，我将它们放在您的坟前，这样，您也算魂归故土了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"审判官艾丽妮","speakerId":"avg_4009_irene_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不过，虽然我当时答应了您，却没想到，这一天来得这么快。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"审判官艾丽妮","speakerId":"avg_4009_irene_1","isRemote":false,"text":"即使在那天之后已经过了一段时间，我也依然无法相信您已经离开。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"审判官艾丽妮","speakerId":"avg_4009_irene_1","isRemote":false,"text":"但是，您终究是离开了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"审判官艾丽妮","speakerId":"avg_4009_irene_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不会再有人呵斥我的幼稚，不会再有人告诫我要多想多看，不会再有人为我遮风挡雨了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"审判官艾丽妮","speakerId":"avg_4009_irene_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......算了，不说这些，如果您还在，听到这些话也肯定会责备我的软弱。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"审判官艾丽妮","speakerId":"avg_4009_irene_1","isRemote":false,"text":"您放心，我还记得，您说，到了这一刻，希望我已经明白了我战斗的意义。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"审判官艾丽妮","speakerId":"avg_4009_irene_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我想，我确实明白了一些。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"审判官艾丽妮","speakerId":"avg_4009_irene_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......所以，未来一段时间，我可能不会来看您了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"审判官艾丽妮","speakerId":"avg_4009_irene_1","isRemote":false,"text":"这并不是因为我对自己的信仰产生了怀疑。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"审判官艾丽妮","speakerId":"avg_4009_irene_1","isRemote":false,"text":"事实上，我正是因为真正理解了审判的含义，才做出了这个决定。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"审判官艾丽妮","speakerId":"avg_4009_irene_1","isRemote":false,"text":"希望您能看着我，老师。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"审判官艾丽妮","speakerId":"avg_4009_irene_1","isRemote":false,"text":"卡门阁下？！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"圣徒卡门","speakerId":"avg_npc_447_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不用紧张，站在这里的，只是一个来为牺牲的学生上坟的老人罢了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"审判官艾丽妮","speakerId":"avg_4009_irene_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"圣徒卡门","speakerId":"avg_npc_447_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你放下的，是达里奥的东西吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"审判官艾丽妮","speakerId":"avg_4009_irene_1","isRemote":false,"text":"是、是的，虽然原本不需要我来将这些放在老师坟前，但我特意去要来了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"审判官艾丽妮","speakerId":"avg_4009_irene_1","isRemote":false,"text":"毕竟我是老师的学生，而且......也是对老师的告别。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"圣徒卡门","speakerId":"avg_npc_447_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哦？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"审判官艾丽妮","speakerId":"avg_4009_irene_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"眼前的人是被冠以圣徒之名的大审判官，每一个审判官都应当知道，圣徒卡门经历了多少考验，又审判了多少邪恶。\n他的存在，就是审判庭意志的化身。\n她有一瞬间后悔自己做出的决定，然而，她马上压下了这个想法。\n她早已决定。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"审判官艾丽妮","speakerId":"avg_4009_irene_1","isRemote":false,"text":"在来到这里前，我去递交了辞呈。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"审判官艾丽妮","speakerId":"avg_4009_irene_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我打算辞去审判官的职务。所以，在离开审判庭前，我想要来这里和老师告别。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"圣徒卡门","speakerId":"avg_npc_447_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"narration","text":"艾丽妮已经做好了被质问甚至责问的准备，然而，迎接她的，却是圣徒的沉默。\n她不敢揣测这沉默意味着什么，但她并没有从圣徒的身上感受到愤怒。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"圣徒卡门","speakerId":"avg_npc_447_1","isRemote":false,"text":"达里奥是我第八个学生，在我所有的学生中，他是最优秀的那一个。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"圣徒卡门","speakerId":"avg_npc_447_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不过，他不善言辞，即使在审判官中，他的人缘也不算好，即便是对我这个老师，也坚持用阁下来称呼。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"圣徒卡门","speakerId":"avg_npc_447_1","isRemote":false,"text":"做他的学生，你不好受。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"审判官艾丽妮","speakerId":"avg_4009_irene_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不会。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"审判官艾丽妮","speakerId":"avg_4009_irene_1","isRemote":false,"text":"老师做事雷厉风行，我很羡慕老师的果断，而且，结果告诉我，老师总是对的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"圣徒卡门","speakerId":"avg_npc_447_1","isRemote":false,"text":"因为他曾经也错过太多。"},{"type":"narration","text":"艾丽妮忽然有一种错觉，自己面对的，不是一个严厉的圣徒，而是一个迟暮的老人。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"圣徒卡门","speakerId":"avg_npc_447_1","isRemote":false,"text":"如果我和达里奥一起前往伊比利亚之眼，他恐怕不会牺牲。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"审判官艾丽妮","speakerId":"avg_4009_irene_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......在黄金船上，那个怪物告诉我老师的死讯时，她说，老师的死毫无意义。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"审判官艾丽妮","speakerId":"avg_4009_irene_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我对她说，审判庭不存在“无意义的牺牲”。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"审判官艾丽妮","speakerId":"avg_4009_irene_1","isRemote":false,"text":"但在那之前，老师曾经教过我，死得其所是一种将死亡浪漫化的说法。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"审判官艾丽妮","speakerId":"avg_4009_irene_1","isRemote":false,"text":"至少对审判官来说，只有活下去，才能履行自己的信念。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"审判官艾丽妮","speakerId":"avg_4009_irene_1","isRemote":false,"text":"所以在说老师的死有意义之前，如果老师能够活着，那就更好了，我是这么想的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"圣徒卡门","speakerId":"avg_npc_447_1","isRemote":false,"text":"达里奥把你教得很好。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"圣徒卡门","speakerId":"avg_npc_447_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"圣徒卡门","speakerId":"avg_npc_447_1","isRemote":false,"text":"在那场灾难席卷整个伊比利亚之后，审判庭在我与其他圣徒的带领下，逐渐形成了现在的规模。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"圣徒卡门","speakerId":"avg_npc_447_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我们做成了许多事，那些事你大多能在经卷上读到。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"圣徒卡门","speakerId":"avg_npc_447_1","isRemote":false,"text":"但其中总有一些事，让我去思考刚才那样的问题——如果我那样做了，是否某个人，甚至某些人可以不用死。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"圣徒卡门","speakerId":"avg_npc_447_1","isRemote":false,"text":"但即便我能够做到许多事，我也只是一个人，或许我做了另一个选择，反而会导致另外的伤亡。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"审判官艾丽妮","speakerId":"avg_4009_irene_1","isRemote":false,"text":"您在告诫我，个人的力量是有限的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"圣徒卡门","speakerId":"avg_npc_447_1","isRemote":false,"text":"难道你的辞职竟然是因为对审判官的道路感到失望？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"审判官艾丽妮","speakerId":"avg_4009_irene_1","isRemote":false,"text":"当然不是......只是我没想到这就被您看穿了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"圣徒卡门","speakerId":"avg_npc_447_1","isRemote":false,"text":"如果是那样，从斯图提斐拉号回来的时候，我就应当从你身上看到畏缩。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"圣徒卡门","speakerId":"avg_npc_447_1","isRemote":false,"text":"而你没有。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"圣徒卡门","speakerId":"avg_npc_447_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你的坚定比之格兰法洛初见时还要纯粹。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"圣徒卡门","speakerId":"avg_npc_447_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我又怎么会怀疑你在退缩？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"审判官艾丽妮","speakerId":"avg_4009_irene_1","isRemote":false,"text":"但是......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"圣徒卡门","speakerId":"avg_npc_447_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我还记得，几年前，达里奥告诉我，他的第一个学生，会是一个年幼的孩童。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"圣徒卡门","speakerId":"avg_npc_447_1","isRemote":false,"text":"为了审判庭的延续，每一个大审判官都需要从审判官中挑选几个学生，将自己的所学传承下去。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"圣徒卡门","speakerId":"avg_npc_447_1","isRemote":false,"text":"但是，一个孩童，十分少见。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"审判官艾丽妮","speakerId":"avg_4009_irene_1","isRemote":false,"text":"经卷拯救了我的生命，但如果没有老师发现我，我可能也会死在那座废墟里吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"审判官艾丽妮","speakerId":"avg_4009_irene_1","isRemote":false,"text":"然后，我被送到了审判庭的孤儿院中，从那时起，老师偶尔会来看一看我。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"审判官艾丽妮","speakerId":"avg_4009_irene_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......老师并不是立刻成为我的老师的。实际上，身为大审判官，按照规定他也不应该教当时身为孤儿的我。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"审判官艾丽妮","speakerId":"avg_4009_irene_1","isRemote":false,"text":"但当他知道我立志要成为一名审判官，并且已经开始接受训练之后，过了一段时间，他忽然告诉我，他会亲自教授我一些东西。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"圣徒卡门","speakerId":"avg_npc_447_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哦？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"审判官艾丽妮","speakerId":"avg_4009_irene_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我对这件事也一直有些疑问，所以后来我找了一个机会询问他这件事，他当时说的话，我至今都记得很清楚。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"27_g16_lighthouse_street"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"大审判官达里奥","speakerId":"avg_npc_183","isRemote":false,"text":"为什么决定让你成为我的学生？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"审判官艾丽妮","speakerId":"avg_4009_irene_1","isRemote":false,"text":"是的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"大审判官达里奥","speakerId":"avg_npc_183","isRemote":false,"text":"因为你对于审判庭的热忱，对于经文与律法的热情，传到了我的耳中。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"审判官艾丽妮","speakerId":"avg_4009_irene_1","isRemote":false,"text":"真的吗？！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"大审判官达里奥","speakerId":"avg_npc_183","isRemote":false,"text":"而这是你最大的弱点。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"审判官艾丽妮","speakerId":"avg_4009_irene_1","isRemote":false,"text":"欸？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"大审判官达里奥","speakerId":"avg_npc_183","isRemote":false,"text":"你的正义来源于那本拯救了你的经卷，来源于审判庭对你的养育，来源于你成为审判官道路上的学习。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"大审判官达里奥","speakerId":"avg_npc_183","isRemote":false,"text":"却不来源于你的双眼见过的景色，你的双耳听过的话语，你的双脚走过的土地。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"大审判官达里奥","speakerId":"avg_npc_183","isRemote":false,"text":"你现在还太过脆弱，艾丽妮。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"27_g26_dusk_wild"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"审判官艾丽妮","speakerId":"avg_4009_irene_1","isRemote":false,"text":"这段话我当时没有理解，老师也不愿意多说，我就一直记着。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"审判官艾丽妮","speakerId":"avg_4009_irene_1","isRemote":false,"text":"直到现在，我才理解了老师这么说的原因。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"审判官艾丽妮","speakerId":"avg_4009_irene_1","isRemote":false,"text":"他害怕我因正义而盲目，因激进而受伤，并因真相而夭折。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"审判官艾丽妮","speakerId":"avg_4009_irene_1","isRemote":false,"text":"因为我曾是那么地相信律法与经卷中的内容就是我的一切。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"圣徒卡门","speakerId":"avg_npc_447_1","isRemote":false,"text":"所以......你开始怀疑审判庭的律法有其局限性。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"审判官艾丽妮","speakerId":"avg_4009_irene_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不，我依然认为律法行之有效。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"圣徒卡门","speakerId":"avg_npc_447_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你想说审判庭的正邪之分过于粗暴。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"审判官艾丽妮","speakerId":"avg_4009_irene_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不，我相信我们的准则经历过考验。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"圣徒卡门","speakerId":"avg_npc_447_1","isRemote":false,"text":"既然如此，你又为什么要离开审判庭？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"审判官艾丽妮","speakerId":"avg_4009_irene_1","isRemote":false,"text":"老师曾经告诉我，在那一刻来临时，我必须是伊比利亚最后的防线。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"审判官艾丽妮","speakerId":"avg_4009_irene_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我曾经觉得，老师对我的要求太高，但现在我却明白，这是他对我最不值一提的要求。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"审判官艾丽妮","speakerId":"avg_4009_irene_1","isRemote":false,"text":"这并不是因为我天赋异禀，也不是因为我肩负着独一无二的使命。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"审判官艾丽妮","speakerId":"avg_4009_irene_1","isRemote":false,"text":"只因为他这么想，并且在这么做。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"审判官艾丽妮","speakerId":"avg_4009_irene_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我身为他的学生，也应当这么做，仅此而已。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"审判官艾丽妮","speakerId":"avg_4009_irene_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我在斯图提斐拉号上懂得了，老师对我的一切教诲，到最后都是要我明白一点——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"审判官艾丽妮","speakerId":"avg_4009_irene_1","isRemote":false,"text":"经文与律法将指导我的行动，但我的行动首先必须遵循我自身的想法。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"审判官艾丽妮","speakerId":"avg_4009_irene_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我必须自己理解，自己相信，然后，经文与律法才会真正成为我的力量，提灯才能真正震慑那些海怪。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"审判官艾丽妮","speakerId":"avg_4009_irene_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我在审判庭底下的囚笼见过了真相，更在斯图提斐拉号上认识了它们的思考与语言，甚至——进化。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"审判官艾丽妮","speakerId":"avg_4009_irene_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我因此看清了我的敌人，也理解了我们所面临的危机。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"审判官艾丽妮","speakerId":"avg_4009_irene_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我与那些猎人同行，和她们共同作战，了解了她们的傲慢，但也看到了她们的强大之处。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"审判官艾丽妮","speakerId":"avg_4009_irene_1","isRemote":false,"text":"她们是未知的，却不一定是可怕的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"圣徒卡门","speakerId":"avg_npc_447_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那么，经历了这一切，孩子，你得出的答案，究竟是什么？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"艾丽妮","speakerId":"avg_4009_irene_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我在真正直面那些怪物的那一刻终于明白，我怀疑过的，也是老师怀疑过的。我担心过的，也是老师担心过的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"艾丽妮","speakerId":"avg_4009_irene_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我的正义曾经经不起考验，老师的强硬却是他深思熟虑的结果。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"艾丽妮","speakerId":"avg_4009_irene_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我不再怀疑，不再犹豫，不再逃避，我要去做我能做，我应该做的事。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"圣徒卡门","speakerId":"avg_npc_447_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"艾丽妮","speakerId":"avg_4009_irene_1","isRemote":false,"text":"呃，对不起，卡门阁下，我好像说了许多不敬的话......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"艾丽妮","speakerId":"avg_4009_irene_1","isRemote":false,"text":"但是，请您相信，我辞去审判官的职务，是为了更好地履行审判官的职责！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"圣徒卡门","speakerId":"avg_npc_447_1","isRemote":false,"text":"审判官的职务太过敏感，只有辞去审判官的职务，才能与其他组织，甚至国家开展交流。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"圣徒卡门","speakerId":"avg_npc_447_1","isRemote":false,"text":"孩子，你看到了合作的曙光。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"圣徒卡门","speakerId":"avg_npc_447_1","isRemote":false,"text":"离开审判庭后，你打算怎么做？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"艾丽妮","speakerId":"avg_4009_irene_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我会先尝试与那三个深海猎人共同行动一段时间。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"艾丽妮","speakerId":"avg_4009_irene_1","isRemote":false,"text":"她们似乎和那个叫罗德岛的组织联系相当密切，我也在考虑要不要和那个组织进行合作。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"圣徒卡门","speakerId":"avg_npc_447_1","isRemote":false,"text":"如果是这样的话......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"圣徒卡门","speakerId":"avg_npc_447_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你都听到了，凯尔希。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"艾丽妮","speakerId":"avg_4009_irene_1","isRemote":false,"text":"咦？！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凯尔希","speakerId":"char_003_kalts","isRemote":false,"text":"抱歉，但刚才的一段对话相当精彩，让我忍不住驻足倾听。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"艾丽妮","speakerId":"avg_4009_irene_1","isRemote":false,"text":"唔欸......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凯尔希","speakerId":"char_003_kalts","isRemote":false,"text":"以及，罗德岛自然不会拒绝与一名出色的前审判官合作。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"圣徒卡门","speakerId":"avg_npc_447_1","isRemote":false,"text":"艾丽妮，你可以辞去审判官的职务，但这并不意味着你需要离开审判庭。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"艾丽妮","speakerId":"avg_4009_irene_1","isRemote":false,"text":"欸？！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"圣徒卡门","speakerId":"avg_npc_447_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你将成为审判庭的信使前往罗德岛，代表审判庭与罗德岛进行合作。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"艾丽妮","speakerId":"avg_4009_irene_1","isRemote":false,"text":"真的吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"圣徒卡门","speakerId":"avg_npc_447_1","isRemote":false,"text":"记住，艾丽妮，你今天做出的决定，将会成为阿戈尔与伊比利亚合作的第二步。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"艾丽妮","speakerId":"avg_4009_irene_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......是！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"圣徒卡门","speakerId":"avg_npc_447_1","isRemote":false,"text":"去吧，做好出行的准备。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"圣徒卡门","speakerId":"avg_npc_447_1","isRemote":false,"text":"这趟新的旅途无人为你引航，但你心中的信念将会为你指引道路。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"艾丽妮","speakerId":"avg_4009_irene_1","isRemote":false,"text":"是！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"圣徒卡门","speakerId":"avg_npc_447_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"圣徒卡门","speakerId":"avg_npc_447_1","isRemote":false,"text":"看啊，凯尔希。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"圣徒卡门","speakerId":"avg_npc_447_1","isRemote":false,"text":"对我而言，阿戈尔与伊比利亚合作的契机在此刻出现，已经太晚太晚。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"圣徒卡门","speakerId":"avg_npc_447_1","isRemote":false,"text":"即便它确实带来了些许转机，岁月在我身上留下的痕迹，也让我无法从中感到丝毫欢欣。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"圣徒卡门","speakerId":"avg_npc_447_1","isRemote":false,"text":"而对她来说，却竟如黎明曙光。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凯尔希","speakerId":"char_003_kalts","isRemote":false,"text":"如果它们的进化是生命的本能，那眼下，这个女孩所做的选择，无疑是文明的本能。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凯尔希","speakerId":"char_003_kalts","isRemote":false,"text":"......嗯？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"圣徒卡门","speakerId":"avg_npc_447_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你在看什么？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"27_g26_dusk_wild"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":null}],"observedOperators":[{"speakerId":"char_003_kalts","aliases":["凯尔希"]}]}
